Error [E2807]: Route `/order-items` is registered both by `routes_same_words/OrderItems.jet` and `routes_same_words/order-items.jet`
  --> tests/ui/web_app_routes_same_words.jet:4:27
    |
  4 | fn run() App -> web.app().routes(from: "routes_same_words").csr()
    |                           ^^^^^^
 Why: Explicit builder entries and `.routes(from:)` conventions must not claim the same path (D-WEBAUTHOR1)
 Fix: Remove one registration, or rename the convention file
